g":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"Mars owns the shrub, and presents it to the use of my countrymen to purge their bodies of choler. The inner rind of the Barberry-tree boiled in white wine, and a quarter of a pint drank each morning, is an excellent remedy to cleanse the body of choleric humours, and free it from such diseases as choler causes, such as scabs, itch, tetters, ringworms, yellow jaundice, boils, &c. It is excellent for hot agues, burnings, scaldings, heat of the blood, heat of the liver, bloody-flux; for the berries are as good as the bark, and more pleasing: they get a man a good stomach to his victuals, by strengthening the attractive faculty which is under Mars. The hair washed with the lye made of the tree and water, will make it turn yellow, _viz._ of Mars’ own colour. The fruit and rind of the shrub, the flowers of broom and of heath, or furz, cleanse the body of choler by sympathy, as the flowers, leaves, and bark of the peach-tree do by antipathy, because these are under Mars, that under Venus.","spans":[{"start":68,"end":96,"concept_id":"constipation","polarity":"action"},{"start":321,"end":326,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":328,"end":332,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":334,"end":341,"concept_id":"dermatitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":343,"end":352,"concept_id":"tinea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":361,"end":369,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":371,"end":376,"concept_id":"abscess","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":406,"end":411,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":413,"end":421,"concept_id":"burns","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":423,"end":432,"concept_id":"burns","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":453,"end":470,"concept_id":"liver_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":472,"end":483,"concept_id":"dysentery","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"cul:024-barberry":{"68":"purges choler, phlegm or melancholy downwar